---
description: Cursor 规则文件存放位置
globs: *.mdc
alwaysApply: false
---
# Cursor 规则文件存放位置

在仓库中放置与组织 Cursor 规则文件的规范。

<rule>
name: cursor_rules_location
description: 将 Cursor 规则文件放在正确目录的标准
filters:
  # Match any .mdc files
  - type: file_extension
    pattern: "\\.mdc$"
  # Match files that look like Cursor rules
  - type: content
    pattern: "(?s)<rule>.*?</rule>"
  # Match file creation events
  - type: event
    pattern: "file_create"

actions:
  - type: reject
    conditions:
      - pattern: "^(?!\\.\\/\\.cursor\\/rules\\/.*\\.mdc$)"
        message: "Cursor 规则文件 (.mdc) 必须放在 .cursor/rules 目录下"

  - type: suggest
    message: |
      创建 Cursor 规则时:

      1. 始终将规则文件放在 PROJECT_ROOT/.cursor/rules/:
         ```
         .cursor/rules/
         ├── your-rule-name.mdc
         ├── another-rule.mdc
         └── ...
         ```

      2. 遵循命名约定:
         - 文件名使用 kebab-case
         - 始终使用 .mdc 扩展名
         - 名称应能描述规则用途

      3. 目录结构:
         ```
         PROJECT_ROOT/
         ├── .cursor/
         │   └── rules/
         │       ├── your-rule-name.mdc
         │       └── ...
         └── ...
         ```

      4. 切勿将规则文件放在:
         - 项目根目录
         - .cursor/rules 以外的子目录
         - 任何其他位置

examples:
  - input: |
      # Bad: Rule file in wrong location
      rules/my-rule.mdc
      my-rule.mdc
      .rules/my-rule.mdc

      # Good: Rule file in correct location
      .cursor/rules/my-rule.mdc
    output: "Cursor 规则文件位置正确"

metadata:
  priority: high
  version: 1.0
</rule>
